+<!--
+  FaqGuidesPage.vue — "/faq/guides" (2026-10-30, PENDING — see relay outbox faq-04-cms-plan.md
+  and faq-05/06-frontend-diff-notes.md). Hand-written, content-only (shared AppHeader/AppFooter
+  from App.vue, not in CHROME_EXCLUDE).
+
+  This is a direct Vue port of the owner's mockup (guide2.html, 2026-10-30): same step-navigator
+  layout (click a step → sticky "device screen" on the right replays that step's schematic;
+  <=860px collapses to one column with the schematic shown inline under each step), same
+  schematic-building DSL (P/f/b/sg/ck/pr/mod/cards/note — ported 1:1, same names/signatures,
+  just producing HTML strings same as the source), same tabs-with-#hash-deep-link behavior.
+
+  Deliberately NOT ported from the mockup: its own <header>/<footer>/nav/logo/avatar — those
+  were for viewing the mockup standalone; the real route already gets the site's real
+  AppHeader/AppFooter. Dark theme removed entirely per owner decision 2026-10-30 (light only) —
+  the mockup's `@media (prefers-color-scheme:dark)` block and `[data-theme="dark"]` overrides are
+  gone, and the custom-property values below are tuned to match /faq*'s existing palette
+  (accent #2e6fd6, ink #1f2733, muted #5b6472, line #e9edf2) rather than the mockup's own navy/
+  blue, per "Стили оформи в тех же классах и цветах, что на /faq*".
+
+  Content: course/stream/money are the owner's mockup content with two factual fixes found by
+  re-checking StreamsPage.vue/StreamCallPage.vue (see the inline comments marked FIX below) —
+  everything else ported verbatim. event/club are NEW (owner decision 2026-10-30, point 1) —
+  written in the same DSL, sourced from the already code-verified expert-guides/instructions/
+  04-meropriyatie.md and 05-klub-podpiska.md, each with a prominent limitation callout. The
+  callout wording is PUBLIC-FACING on purpose (owner decision 2026-10-30, round 2): no mention
+  of the adv@meetgu.ru service account or "platform administration" — just "the platform team
+  sets this up with you, contact support" for both event and club. (Internally: events can only
+  be created today by that one hardcoded account, and there's no self-service club-creation
+  screen at all — true, but not something to spell out to the reader.)
+
+  Russian only (owner decision — no lang switch here, unlike FaqPage.vue).
+-->
+<template>
